       "text": "Fixed a progression block in Gala Night 1 where suction pipe doesn't send Penny high enough",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed input lock that could occur by pressing left face button on the main menu",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Reinforced the fix to the Player Cannon in World's Edge: Thanks for your patience and support!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
